'''Unferth's patch''' is a special [[farming patch]] located outside of [[Unferth]]'s house in [[Burthorpe]]. During [[A Tail of Two Cats]], the player must [[rake]] the patch, plant [[potato seed]]s in it, and harvest [[potato]]es from it as one of the [[Bob (cat)|Bob]]'s [[chores]]. The patch does not need to be watered or composted, and the potato plants in it fully grow in significantly less time than normal potatoes. 

==Success chance==
{{DropLogProject|jagex=yes|success=yes}}

The chance of successfully raking a patch depends on your Farming level. Successfully raking will reduce the amount of weeds in the patch by 1 stage, add 1 [[weeds]] to your inventory, and grant 4 Farming experience; if you fail, you will automatically attempt to rake it again in {{ticks|3}}. Once successfully raked 3 times, the patch is ready to be planted.
